16344 Sep  2 22:16 build.rs\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord  14556 Sep  2 22:16 Cargo.lock\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    850 Sep  2 22:16 Cargo.toml\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     64 Sep  2 22:16 .claude\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    173 Sep  2 22:16 CLAUDE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   1688 Sep  2 22:16 clippy.toml\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   6295 Sep  2 22:16 CONTEXT.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     84 Sep  2 22:16 docs\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord 153838 Sep  2 22:16 draft.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    144 Sep  2 22:16 examples\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord     73 Sep  2 22:16 .git\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord     38 Sep  2 22:16 .gitattributes\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     18 Sep  2 22:16 .github\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    171 Sep  2 22:16 .gitignore\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   1759 Sep  2 22:16 justfile\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord   1768 Sep  2 22:16 plans\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    394 Sep  2 22:16 prelude.toy\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   5062 Sep  2 22:16 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord   3658 Sep  2 22:16 research-log\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     18 Sep  2 22:16 runtime\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    326 Sep  2 22:16 site\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    366 Sep  2 22:16 src\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    858 Sep  2 22:16 tests\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls -la","time":{"start":1788381709928,"end":1788381709934}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me understand the task. I need to implement Float (IEEE binary64 per ADR 0007) for the Lua backend only, one commit. I should:\n1. Read AGENTS.md (done)\n2. Look at the issue (#149) (done)\n3. Read src/emit_js.rs (the reference implementation for Float)\n4. Read src/emit_lua.rs (the file I need to change)\n5. Port the Float handling using Lua host-hook syntax\n6. Add or extend a corpus test under tests/corpus/ that exercises Float on the Lua backend\n7. Test with `just check`\n8. Commi